Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix: serialize V1OwnerReference with wire names in GKE
 code executor

Pass V1OwnerReference directly in patch_body when patching the code ConfigMap so patch_namespaced_config_map serializes it with Kubernetes wire field names, and return a V1Job from the mock create_namespaced_job in unit tests.

Previously, owner_reference.to_dict() omitted the wire apiVersion field, causing patch_namespaced_config_map to fail with a warning and leaving job-mode code-src-* ConfigMaps orphaned in the cluster. Users upgrading from earlier versions should clean up any leaked code-src-* ConfigMaps.

Closes #7443
Closes #7444

PiperOrigin-RevId: 996083470
